# Leave NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL unset for the Docker stack: Caddy serves the UI
# and the API from one origin, and the client falls back to a relative
# "/api/v1". That fallback is what keeps the API URL out of the built bundle —
# Next inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* at build time, so a value set here would be frozen
# into the image.
#
# Set it only for the native dev loop, where uvicorn runs on its own port:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
